    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0e Guide a young bird on his quest to find the Chalice of Highland \u2694\ufe0e</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Chalice of Highland, embark on an epic adventure inspired by Gameboy aesthetics. Explore the world and dive into six challenging dungeons to recover the Chalice of Highland. As a brave bird, you\u2019ll wield a sword to battle enemies and use your unique ability to fly, uncovering secrets along the way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features :</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    6 Unique Dungeons: Each dungeon presents its own mechanics and challenges, keeping the gameplay fresh and exciting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    7 Epic Bosses: Face off against formidable bosses guarding each piece of the Chalice of Highland.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    7 Dream Sequences: Uncover the hero's backstory through dream sequences that reveal the mysterious past of the Highlands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Customizable Screen Colors: Choose from different screen color palettes to enhance your retro gaming experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Classic or Widescreen: Play in the original Gameboy format or switch to a 16:9 widescreen view for a modern twist.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0e Guide a young bird on his quest to find the Chalice of Highland \u2694\ufe0e</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Chalice of Highland, embark on an epic adventure inspired by Gameboy aesthetics. Explore the world and dive into six challenging dungeons to recover the Chalice of Highland. As a brave bird, you\u2019ll wield a sword to battle enemies and use your unique ability to fly, uncovering secrets along the way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features :</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    6 Unique Dungeons: Each dungeon presents its own mechanics and challenges, keeping the gameplay fresh and exciting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    7 Epic Bosses: Face off against formidable bosses guarding each piece of the Chalice of Highland.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    7 Dream Sequences: Uncover the hero's backstory through dream sequences that reveal the mysterious past of the Highlands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Customizable Screen Colors: Choose from different screen color palettes to enhance your retro gaming experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Classic or Widescreen: Play in the original Gameboy format or switch to a 16:9 widescreen view for a modern twist.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "\u2694\ufe0e Embark on an epic adventure inspired by Gameboy aesthetics. Explore the world and dive into six challenging dungeons to recover the Chalice of Higland \u2694\ufe0e",
